# Claude Code MCP servers — Memory overlay (opt-in)
# Load via: DOTFILES_WORKFLOWS=developer,memory
# Engram = manual-only per CLAUDE.md. Graphiti = disabled until needed at scale.

# Engram — cross-platform wrapper: WSL uses Windows binary + vault, others use native.
engram | ~/.claude/scripts/engram.sh

# Graphiti — temporal knowledge graph (Neo4j) on superbro:8000. Tailscale-only.
graphiti | http | http://100.100.1.50:8000/mcp
